      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "# **Welcome to** **EuroSense.**\n\n# **Citizen Sensor Network**"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "## Bridging Divides, Growing Solutions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "670cc47578d2e23ca4af48fb",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### A Europe-wide citizen science network\n\n### making the voices of European citizens heard\n\n### by activists, policy makers and governments.\n\n### By understanding the experiences of citizens in public life,\n\n### we sense the pulse of Europe.\n\n### This informs us how to overcome polarization and\n\n### collectively tackle the challenges of our times\n\n### such as climate change, inequality, immigration and security."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/Europe-Network-bf954525.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "67094786712e2f1d909dc6b5",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/media/Mano-03-9e992e6b.png",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "markdown": "### We use _SenseMaker_, an innovative online tool, to gather real-life stories from various communities.\n\n### Designed by experts, this tool lets individuals share and interpret their own experiences.\n\n### Activists and policymakers can use it to identify patterns, emerging issues, and guide positive change in society."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Share your story",
          "href": "https://collector.sensemaker-suite.com/collector?projectID=d1c06283-3a51-4050-ac6d-ea29ae75f32c&ID=eurosense"
        }
      ]
    },
